WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.006 --> 00:00:09.297
Open a semester: Select its name to explore courses and possible exam schedules.

2
00:00:09.297 --> 00:00:38.616
Compare your options: Temporarily exclude a selected course to compare exam gaps and credits.

3
00:00:38.616 --> 00:01:07.542
A comparison, not a deletion: Turn the course back on. Your saved plan stays unchanged.
